Package: FTucker3
Title: Basis-Preserving Tucker Decomposition for Three-Way Functional Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Roberto William",
           family = "Cascante Yarlequé",
           email = "rcascantey@unemi.edu.ec",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Implements a basis-preserving Tucker decomposition for three-way
    functional data. Provides orthonormal Fourier basis expansion, construction
    of functional coefficient tensors, orthogonal alternating estimation of
    structural loading matrices and functional core tensors, reconstruction,
    and cell-wise cross-validation for selecting structural ranks.
